<script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"FAQPage","@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/julian-reese/#faq","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://nbasalaries.com/players/julian-reese/"},"mainEntity":[{"@type":"Question","name":"What Is Julian Reese’s Salary in 2026-27?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reese earns $679k in 2026-27 on a two-way contract with New Orleans. He was paid $161k by Washington last season, a prorated two-way salary after he signed in February. His career earnings come to $840k across two seasons. Two-way contracts sit outside the salary cap, so his salary is not counted in the Pelicans’ $196.53m payroll."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"What’s Next for Julian Reese Beyond 2026?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"The contract covers this season only. New Orleans can convert it to a standard deal at any point, and if it does not he returns to free agency in the summer of 2027 at 24."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Does Julian Reese Earn Over Time?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"A $679k season is hard to picture, so here's what it comes to over smaller stretches of time."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Long Is Julian Reese’s Contract With the Pelicans?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reese signed a two-way contract with the Pelicans on September 24, 2026 worth $679k, of which $91k is protected. Washington traded him to Denver in the five-team Peyton Watson deal in August, and the Nuggets waived him about a week later. His Wizards deal had nothing guaranteed for this season, so no dead money is owed."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"How Much Is Julian Reese’s Net Worth?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reese’s net worth is estimated at around $340k, taken from his $840k in career earnings. No outlet publishes a figure for him. He played four seasons at Maryland and went undrafted in 2025 at 21. He is the brother of WNBA player Angel Reese."}},{"@type":"Question","name":"Why Is Julian Reese on a Two-Way Contract?","acceptedAnswer":{"@type":"Answer","text":"Reese is paid $679k because he is on a two-way contract, and the two-way rate is fixed by the collective agreement for everyone on one. New Orleans is the fourth NBA club he has been with in a year."}}]}</script>
